Z||000008||Fformula88||01-29-2001||05:15 PM||||Congrats on your new car!  A fine choice if I may say so  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>If I were you, I'd do those brakes myself.  With the redesigned suspennsion, 88 brake jobs can get expensive very quickly.  I got a couple very scary quotes (one was $800 for just the rear!!).  I ended up doing the work myself and only spent $200.  <P>Good luck with the car and have FUN  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>John<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">     <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1987 Fiero Sport Coupe *In rebuilding*<BR>1997 Ford Probe SE<BR>AOL IM: Fformula88||||reg||1
