Z||000013||Formula88||01-30-2001||01:29 PM||||Yea, I'm definately doing the mechanicals myself - with a good friend's help, of course.  Thanks for getting me hooked, LZeitgeist!  Oh, and I didn't get the car in SC.  It came from a Raleigh, NC owner.  I was just VERY lucky to find the car I wanted, at the price I could afford, and right in my back yard.  The only unknown really (other than when you buy any 13 year old car) is the emissions.  It has a saftey only inspection, not an emissions inspection which is required here.  So, I gotta find out if she'll pass.  And with NCFieros first Raleigh meeting this Saturday, I'm all set, baby!<P>------------------<BR>When you choke a smurf, what color does it turn?||||reg||6
